OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AIndia's costliest film retells a
OL,4,Abeloved Hindu epic - but divides
OL,5,Acritics
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne of Hinduism's foundational epics,
OL,8,Fthe Ramayana has travelled across
OL,9,Fcenturies and continents, finding
OL,10,Fexpression in poetry, temple sculpture,
OL,11,Fshadow puppetry, folk theatre and
OL,12,Fstories passed down through
OL,13,Fgenerations. It has outlasted kingdoms
OL,14,Fand empires, inspired religious
OL,15,Fdevotion and political movements, and
OL,16,Ffound new life, again and again, on TV
OL,17,Fand in cinema.
OL,19,FTiwari's version returns to the
OL,20,Ffamiliar story of love, duty, exile and
OL,21,Fwar, set in a world of gods and demons,
OL,22,Fcelestial weapons and mighty kingdoms.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
